  "_howto": "Copy to data/<slug>.json, fill in, share index.html?p=<slug>. Any text can be a string OR {\"en\":\"...\",\"el\":\"...\"}. Images go in data/img/ (jpg/png/svg) and are referenced by path. Delete sections/cards you don't need. Remove _ comment fields before publishing.",
