  "_languages": "supported flags: en, el, fr, de, it",
  "_new_home_screen": "Optional fields for the new home screen — all optional, safe to delete: meta.heroImages (array of photos for a swipeable hero, falls back to heroImage), meta.coords {lat,lng} (shows a live weather badge on the hero card, no API key needed), meta.googleReviewUrl (a 5-star tap opens this), section.subtitle (small line under a tile's title), section.area:true (tags a section to appear on the Area tab). The top-level 'home' array controls exactly which tiles show on the home screen, in order — each tile points to a section ('section'), optionally jumps straight to one card/group inside it ('cardMatch', matched against that card's or group's 'key'), or opens a bottom-nav tab directly ('tab': 'area'|'contact'|'guide'). Delete the whole 'home' array to fall back to one tile per section automatically.",
  "_search": "The home search bar searches ALL card content (titles, text, wifi, codes, checklists) — not just tile labels — and understands synonyms (e.g. 'internet' finds Wi-Fi). A microphone button appears for voice search where the browser supports it (Chrome, Android, iOS Safari; follows the guide's language). Add property-specific synonyms via meta.searchAliases, e.g. {\"internet\":[\"wifi\"],\"aircon\":[\"air conditioning\"]}.",
